        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest Case 1 : Start with health H=9H = 9H=9 at vertex 111 and perform the following moves:\n\nKill the monster at node 333. H=9−4=5H = 9 - 4 = 5H=9−4=5.\nMove to node 222 (H≥A2H \\ge A_2H≥A2​ and H≥A3H \\ge A_3H≥A3​ are satisfied).\nKill the monster at 222. H=5−2=3H = 5 - 2 = 3H=5−2=3.\nMove to node 111 (H≥A1H \\ge A_1H≥A1​ and H≥A2H \\ge A_2H≥A2​ are satisfied).\nKill the monster at 111. H=3−3=0H = 3 - 3 = 0H=3−3=0.\n\nYou have successfully defeated all monsters.\nTest case 2 : Start at vertex 111 with 120120120 health, kill the monster here, move to vertex 222 and kill the monster there.\nWith a smaller initial health value, it is not possible to move between the 222 nodes after killing a monster regardless of starting at 111 or 222. Hence, the answer is 120120120."
